{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00116","headline":"石淙 · 睿宗皇帝","name":"石淙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奇峰嶾嶙箕山北，秀崿岹嶢嵩镇南。\n地首地肺何曾拟，天目天台倍觉慙。\n树影蒙茏鄣叠岫，波深汹涌落悬潭。\n□愿紫宸居得一，永欣丹扆御通三。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"睿宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}